 lq('b2l1c',[('M','Honestly, the new manager has some good ideas, but she doesn\'t listen. She makes decisions without asking anyone, and then wonders why people aren\'t enthusiastic.'),('F','Maybe give her time. It\'s only been a month.')],'You hear two colleagues talking. What does the man criticise about the manager?',['her lack of experience','her ideas','the way she makes decisions'],2,['attitude'],'Kimseye sormadan karar veriyor.'),
