 lq('b2l5b',[('M','I\'m calling about the advert for the flat in Green Street. Is it still available? And could you tell me whether pets are allowed? I\'ve got a small dog.')],'You hear a man leaving a message. What does he want to know?',['how much the rent is','whether he can keep an animal','where the flat is'],1,['purpose'],'Evcil hayvana izin olup olmadığını soruyor.'),
 lq('b2l5c',[('F','Have you tried that new podcast about history?'),('M','I listened to one episode. The presenters clearly know their stuff, but they kept interrupting each other. I found it really hard to follow.')],'What does the man think of the podcast?',['The presenters are not knowledgeable.','It is difficult to follow.','The episodes are too long.'],1,['attitude'],'Sunucular birbirinin sözünü kesiyor; takip etmesi zor.'),
